OL,3,AAnthropic boss Dario Amodei calls for
OL,4,AAI development to slow down
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe head of leading AI company
OL,7,FAnthropic has called for the pace of
OL,8,Fdevelopment of artificial intelligence
OL,9,Fmodels to slow down and to be closely
OL,10,Fmonitored.
OL,12,FIn an essay on Saturday, Dario Amodei
OL,13,Fsaid developing AI was not in question,
OL,14,Fbut the risks associated with it were
OL,15,F"serious" and companies and governments
OL,16,Fmust be given time to address them.
OL,18,FHe proposed a three-point plan that
OL,19,Fincludes independent monitoring of AI
OL,20,Fmodels as they are developed,
OL,21,Findustry-wide regulation and global
OL,22,Fregulation.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/19
