OL,3,AOscar-winning film producer Jeremy
OL,4,AThomas dies aged 77
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe best known work, Bernardo
OL,7,FBertolucci's The Last Emperor, won nine
OL,8,FAcademy Awards, including best picture,
OL,9,Fand earned Thomas an Oscar as producer.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/19
