OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AFive minutes to steal a Renoir: Why
OL,4,Amuseum thefts are becoming bolder
OL,5,Aacross Europe
OL,6,
OL,7,FAnd just days before the Renoir heist,
OL,8,Finternationally known art detective
OL,9,FArthur Brand predicted to the BBC that
OL,10,Fmore high-profile burglaries were
OL,11,Flikely - particularly in the wake of
OL,12,Fthe successful robbery at the Louvre in
OL,13,FParis last October.
OL,15,FThe audacious crime in one of the
OL,16,Fworld's most famous museums stunned
OL,17,FFrance, and the stolen jewellery worth
OL,18,FbB,88m (#75m) has still not been
OL,19,Frecovered, nearly a year on.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/19
